## 6. Type Cosplay

Attacker passes account of different type with same data layout.

```rust
// VULNERABLE - different account types with same layout
#[account]
pub struct User {
    pub authority: Pubkey,  // 32 bytes
}

#[account]
pub struct Admin {
    pub authority: Pubkey,  // 32 bytes - same layout!
}

// User could pass User account where Admin is expected

// SECURE - Anchor discriminator (automatic with #[account])
// Anchor adds 8-byte discriminator to distinguish types

// Manual check
if user.discriminant != AccountDiscriminant::User {
    return Err(ProgramError::InvalidAccountData.into());
}
```

