## 10. PDA Sharing Vulnerability

```rust
// VULNERABLE - single PDA for multiple users/pools
#[derive(Accounts)]
pub struct Withdraw<'info> {
    #[account(
        seeds = [b"vault", pool.mint.as_ref()],  // Only mint as seed
        bump
    )]
    pub vault_authority: AccountInfo<'info>,
    pub pool: Account<'info, Pool>,
}

// Any pool with same mint shares the vault authority!
// Pool A's vault could sign for Pool B's tokens

// SECURE - include unique identifier in seeds
#[derive(Accounts)]
pub struct Withdraw<'info> {
    #[account(
        seeds = [b"vault", pool.key().as_ref()],  // Pool address as seed
        bump
    )]
    pub vault_authority: AccountInfo<'info>,
    pub pool: Account<'info, Pool>,
}
```

