## 11. Arithmetic Issues

```rust
// VULNERABLE - panic on overflow/underflow (Rust default)
pub fn transfer(amount: u64, balance: u64) -> u64 {
    balance - amount  // Panics if amount > balance
}

// SECURE - checked arithmetic
pub fn transfer(amount: u64, balance: u64) -> Result<u64> {
    balance.checked_sub(amount)
        .ok_or(ErrorCode::InsufficientBalance.into())
}

// For wrapping (when intentional)
amount.wrapping_add(1)

// For saturating (clamps to max/min)
amount.saturating_sub(1)
```

